    "Machine read and private final checker use actual FOR SHARE plus fresh post-wait DB clock; final shared publication remains explicitly outside MA1.",
    "Exact signature-to-role ACL matrix and creator-default inspection before normalization address the earlier S1-copy hazards. Existing postgres/default privileges/#1142 remain untouched.",
    "Native minimal fixture and genuine restricted session_user prevent bootstrap-superuser escalation-test vacuity. Three-table post-lock rollback emptiness and actual wait predicates are explicit.",
    "SQL timestamp and remaining_ms plan uses strict canonical input and conservative full-precision DB remaining duration; complementary lifetime reviewer owns adapter reproof clipping/control-drain issues."
